        <span class="eyebrow reveal"><svg class="iris-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>Who it is for</span>
        <h2 class="h2 who-title reveal" data-d="1">Teams with a real problem to solve.</h2>
        <p class="lead reveal" data-d="2">You do not need to know what the technology should be. You need to know where the work is slow, repetitive or stuck.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-list reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="principle"><span class="pk" aria-hidden="true">i.</span><div><h3>Teams buried in manual work</h3><p>People re-keying data, chasing approvals or moving files by hand, and wanting that time back.</p></div></div>
        <div class="principle"><span class="pk" aria-hidden="true">ii.</span><div><h3>Businesses the standard tools do not fit</h3><p>You have tried off-the-shelf software and the way you work does not fit it.</p></div></div>
        <div class="principle"><span class="pk" aria-hidden="true">iii.</span><div><h3>Leaders who want to know where the time goes</h3><p>You suspect there are gaps in how the operation runs and want someone to find them and fix the biggest ones.</p></div></div>
